me the heritage of those that fear thy name.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Thou wilt prolong the king’s life: and his years as many generations.","poem":1},{"noteId":353},{"noteId":354}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"He shall abide before God for ever: O prepare mercy and truth, which may preserve him.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"So will I sing praise unto thy name for ever, that I may daily perform my vows.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":352,"caller":"+","text":"61.4 trust: or, make my refuge","reference":{"chapter":61,"verse":4}},{"noteId":353,"caller":"+","text":"61.6 Thou…: Heb. Thou shalt add days to the days of the king","reference":{"chapter":61,"verse":6}},{"noteId":354,"caller":"+","text":"61.6 as…: Heb. as generation and generation","reference":{"chapter":61,"verse":6}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/eng_kja/PSA/61.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/eng_kja/PSA/62.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/eng_kja/PSA/60.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}